      "writtenOn": "2026-03-04T22:01:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently the assumption is that all marks are on Page streams. It appears the purpose of this change is to also properly export marks on FormXObject streams. However, this means that the mark needs to remember where it came from (currently this is by recording the page number) and emit something like\n```\n\u003c\u003c/Type /MCR\n/Pg 2 0 R %optional, overrides outer /Pg\n/Stm 4 0 R %Stream containing marked-content sequence (eg, FormXObject)\n/MCID 0 %Marked-content identifier (in the Stm)\n\u003e\u003e\n```\nin order to point the structure element at the right child marks. See ISO 32000-2:2020﻿ 14.7.5.2 Marked-content sequences as content items Example 5.",
      "revId": "1b9d59ea70862f36217d49246ae4b36c12b074ad",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
